<p>This specialization is crucial: by distributing long-range attention across groups, the model covers more of the context than any single group could. Group 1 might track code structure from early blocks; Group 2 might track narrative references; Groups 3–4 fill in other long-range dependencies. Together they achieve a diverse, covering sparse pattern.</p>
</section>

<!-- §04 FIXED KV BUDGET -->
